      "value": "This plain wooden bead dangles from a string attached to the stock of the affixed weapon. When you activate the bead, its magic greatly lessens the effect of distance on your triggering attack.\n\nYou take no range increment penalty on your attack, as long as the attack is against a target within the affixed weapon's first four range increments.\n\nActivate (Free Action); Components envision; Trigger You attempt a ranged Strike with the affixed weapon before rolling; Requirements You're a master with the affixed weapon."
